    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know... i'll try to talk to someone. it's just that it feels so final. like, there's no coming back from this. you can't un-ring a bell, you know? everyone has decided who i am now. it's like the version of me that actually belonged here is just... gone. and i'm just stuck in this shell of a person that nobody wants to look at. it feels like there's no point in even trying to fix it when everything is already broken.",
